pkl-rs
Copyright 2025 OpenEdges Inc.

This product is a pure Rust reimplementation of Apple's Pkl configuration language.
It is not a fork or copy of the original source code, but an independent implementation
targeting behavioral compatibility with Pkl v0.30.2.

This product includes test fixture files from the original Pkl project for compatibility
testing purposes.

